  "title": "Oven Roasted Saudi Arabian Gouda Cheese Kebabs",
  "description": "A light and quick Saudi Arabian dish featuring roasted Gouda cheese with a char-grill flavor, suitable for vegan diets when using vegan Gouda alternative, cooked in a tandoor clay pot for a traditional touch.",
