  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Cut the Gouda cheese alternative into 1-inch cubes.",
    "Thread the cheese cubes onto skewers, leaving a small space between each cube.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the oil mixture evenly onto the cheese cubes.",
    "Place the skewers in the tandoor clay pot or a similar oven-safe vessel.",
    "Roast the cheese kebabs in the preheated oven for 10-12 minutes, or until lightly browned.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and mint.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy."
